--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. ANIMATION TIMELINE REGISTRY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A. [Anim_CardHighlight] (Duration: 0.25s):
   - Scaled card pop: RenderScale goes from (1.0, 1.0) to (1.06, 1.06) with Elastic EaseOut.
   - Border emissive: Increases Dynamic Material Parameter "IsSelected" to 1.0.

B. [Anim_StatBarFill] (Duration: 0.4s):
   - Smooth interpolation of ProgressBar percentages from current to new car values.

C. [Anim_CarTransition] (Duration: 0.3s):
   - 3D Preview Turntable camera pans and refocuses with depth of field blur.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. SOUND BINDINGS:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   - SFX_Hover: SoundCue'/Game/Audio/UI/SC_UI_Hover'
   - SFX_CardSelect: SoundCue'/Game/Audio/UI/SC_UI_CardSelect' (Power-up chirp)
   - SFX_ConfirmLock: SoundCue'/Game/Audio/UI/SC_UI_LockIn' (Heavy mechanical latch)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. C++ DELEGATES & EVENT GRAPH:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Variables:
   - CurrentSelectedCar: ECarType (Default = ECarType::Supercar)
   - TargetGameMode: AVELOCITYXGameMode
   - TargetGameInstance: UVELOCITYXGameInstance

Event Construct:
   1. Get GameMode -> Cast to AVELOCITYXGameMode -> Store TargetGameMode
   2. Get GameInstance -> Cast to UVELOCITYXGameInstance -> Store TargetGameInstance
   3. Bind Event to GameMode::OnCarSelected Delegate
   4. Bind Event to GameMode::OnGameStateChanged Delegate
   5. Read GameInstance BestLapTimes:
      - BestLapTimes[0] -> Set BestLap_Supercar
      - BestLapTimes[1] -> Set BestLap_TrackSupercar
      - BestLapTimes[2] -> Set BestLap_Hypercar
   6. CurrentSelectedCar = TargetGameMode->GetSelectedCarType()
   7. Call UpdateSelectedCarUI(CurrentSelectedCar)

Function UpdateSelectedCarUI(ECarType NewCar):
   1. CurrentSelectedCar = NewCar
   2. Play Sound 2D (SFX_CardSelect)
   3. Switch (NewCar):
      Case ECarType::Supercar:
         - DynMat_CardSupercar->SetScalarParameterValue("IsSelected", 1.0)
         - DynMat_CardTrackSupercar->SetScalarParameterValue("IsSelected", 0.0)
         - DynMat_CardHypercar->SetScalarParameterValue("IsSelected", 0.0)
         - Status_Supercar->SetText("[ SELECTED ]") (Neon Green)
         - Status_TrackSupercar->SetText("SELECT") (Gray)
         - Status_Hypercar->SetText("SELECT") (Gray)
         - Txt_HP_Value->SetText("500 HP (470 N*m)")
         - Txt_TS_Value->SetText("320 KM/H (199 MPH)")
         - Txt_Acc_Value->SetText("3.5 SECONDS")
         - Txt_Hand_Value->SetText("85 / 100")
         - Bar_TopSpeed->SetPercent(0.76)
         - Bar_Acceleration->SetPercent(0.85)
         - Bar_Handling->SetPercent(0.85)
         - Txt_SpecialPerk->SetText("SPECIAL: BALANCED SLIP ANGLE CONTROL")

      Case ECarType::TrackSupercar:
         - DynMat_CardSupercar->SetScalarParameterValue("IsSelected", 0.0)
         - DynMat_CardTrackSupercar->SetScalarParameterValue("IsSelected", 1.0)
         - DynMat_CardHypercar->SetScalarParameterValue("IsSelected", 0.0)
         - Status_TrackSupercar->SetText("[ SELECTED ]") (Neon Green)
         - Txt_HP_Value->SetText("720 HP (800 N*m)")
         - Txt_TS_Value->SetText("355 KM/H (221 MPH)")
         - Txt_Acc_Value->SetText("2.8 SECONDS")
         - Txt_Hand_Value->SetText("98 / 100")
         - Bar_TopSpeed->SetPercent(0.85)
         - Bar_Acceleration->SetPercent(0.93)
         - Bar_Handling->SetPercent(0.98)
         - Txt_SpecialPerk->SetText("SPECIAL: ACTIVE DUAL-ELEMENT WING & DRS")

      Case ECarType::Hypercar:
         - DynMat_CardSupercar->SetScalarParameterValue("IsSelected", 0.0)
         - DynMat_CardTrackSupercar->SetScalarParameterValue("IsSelected", 0.0)
         - DynMat_CardHypercar->SetScalarParameterValue("IsSelected", 1.0)
         - Status_Hypercar->SetText("[ SELECTED ]") (Neon Green)
         - Txt_HP_Value->SetText("1500 HP (1600 N*m)")
         - Txt_TS_Value->SetText("420 KM/H (261 MPH)")
         - Txt_Acc_Value->SetText("2.4 SECONDS")
         - Txt_Hand_Value->SetText("78 / 100")
         - Bar_TopSpeed->SetPercent(1.00)
         - Bar_Acceleration->SetPercent(0.98)
         - Bar_Handling->SetPercent(0.78)
         - Txt_SpecialPerk->SetText("SPECIAL: QUAD-TURBO HYBRID BOOST & AWD CATAPULT")

   4. Play Animation (Anim_StatBarFill)
   5. TargetGameMode->SelectCar(CurrentSelectedCar)

On Clicked (CardButton_Supercar):
   UpdateSelectedCarUI(ECarType::Supercar)

On Clicked (CardButton_TrackSupercar):
   UpdateSelectedCarUI(ECarType::TrackSupercar)

On Clicked (CardButton_Hypercar):
   UpdateSelectedCarUI(ECarType::Hypercar)

On Clicked (Btn_Confirm):
   1. Play Sound 2D (SFX_ConfirmLock)
   2. TargetGameMode->SelectCar(CurrentSelectedCar)
   3. TargetGameMode->SetGameState(EGameState::Racing)
   4. Open Level "HighwayCorridor_Map"

On Clicked (Btn_Back):
   1. TargetGameMode->SetGameState(EGameState::MainMenu)
   2. Create Widget (BP_MainMenu) -> Add to Viewport
   3. Remove from Parent (Self)
================================================================================
*/
